MM is a gym located at leased premises in Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi. Because of competition and other issues, MM is facing financial difficulties and is not meeting its liabilities. All the efforts to revive the business, cut costs, or even sell the business were unsuccessful. Payments to equipment suppliers and maintenance agencies are due for supplies/services provided in the previous 3 months amounting to around two lakh rupees. The rent for its premises remains unpaid for 3 month…";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1760514220;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:40:"case_studies:insolvency_bankruptcy:case3";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:3106;s:9:"timestamp";i:1760514220;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:6:"plugin";a:1:{s:13:"plugin_acmenu";a:1:{s:6:"sub_ns";a:3:{i:0;s:34:"case_studies:insolvency_bankruptcy";i:1;s:12:"case_studies";i:2;s:0:"";}}}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1760534181;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1760514220;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:40:"case_studies:insolvency_bankruptcy:case3";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:3106;s:9:"timestamp";i:1760514220;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}